# Exercise 02: Telecom Data Cleaning Using Python and Pandas

## Overview

This exercise focuses on preparing raw telecom usage data for analysis using Python and the Pandas library.

The practical involved creating a CSV dataset, loading it into a Pandas DataFrame, identifying and handling missing values, removing duplicate records, standardising date information, and exporting the cleaned dataset.

The exercise demonstrates the importance of data preprocessing in telecom analytics, where raw operational data may contain inconsistencies that affect the reliability of downstream analysis.

